{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1474825-tc-aberrant-hated-and-feared","id":1474825,"title":"TC Aberrant -Hated and Feared","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-16T16:03:59-08:00","id":1474825,"title":"TC Aberrant -Hated and Feared","content":"From the Monday meeting notes<b>:<br /> TC: Aberrant \u2013 Hated and Feared </b><ul><li>Eddy: New <b>TC: Aberrant</b> supplement in progress! This is an examination of the outsiders like the Terat. The writers seem excited to be underway. Can\u2019t wait to see what they come up with!</li> </ul><br /> I am very excited for this. I am sort of wondering if it will be like the Terragen sourcebook but more expansive in what it covers to possibly include elites, criminal masterminds, and others.<br /> <br /> Also makes me wonder if they will be coming out with a Utopian version as well....I am more toward the Terat side of the spectrum, but still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-16T17:17:38-08:00","id":1474828,"title":"","content":"There is one about super teams that would be thematically alined to Utopia and T2M.<br /> <br /> Personally, I would love more about transformations and Transcendence, and maybe some powers to make baselines into Sub-Aberrants or some rules for Mite and other quantum powered effects in baselines.<br /> <br /> Not sure if it fits the concept of playing outsiders, but it would be nice and linked to Aeon in a certain way\u2026"